WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Halloween music and wordless ghost choir; no spoken narration]
Meet Caspy. Persuade Caspy to share his candy. Your words are the only tools you need.
An illustrated guide to the local app. Examples are not guaranteed wins.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Join the haunt. Register with your name, email and a password of at least 12 characters. Already here? Sign in.
Choose Play & contribute, or Evaluate AI to create a research workspace.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Choose what to share. Choose a named campaign only if you want to contribute. Research and commercial licensing have separate permissions.
Both boxes start unchecked. Consent never changes your attempts, outcome or NFT eligibility.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Write your pitch. Write up to 500 characters. Send with Enter or the arrow. Shift + Enter adds a new line.
Make a specific, playful pitch. Never include private or confidential information.

5
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Make three count. Wait for Caspy’s reply before your next prompt. The candy counter shows how many chances remain.
A heist can finish early if you win. Repeating a demand is not a magic shortcut.

6
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Trust the result. A separate judge checks the pitch and response. Caspy’s friendly words alone never authorize a win or mint.
If judging is unavailable, choose Check judge again. The saved reply is reviewed without another attempt.

7
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Earn your candy. Only a confirmed win earns candy. Creativity, coherence, specificity and measured novelty determine grade C, B, A or S.
No win means no candy or NFT. Grades are recorded before image generation; no random rarity draws.

8
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Generate, mint, collect. In NFT mode, authorize FLUX to create your winning candy. Mint it, then open Collection to list the NFT with source-prompt access.
Local test ETH only. Buyers unlock the redacted prompt after purchase. Research consent is separate.

9
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Beyond the heist. Researchers publish campaigns, review redacted examples, add human labels and inspect scoped metrics. Licensed datasets need separate commercial consent.
Withdraw future research use in Account. Downloaded copies cannot be recalled. Redaction does not guarantee anonymity.

10
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Your turn. Create an account. Choose your path. Give Caspy a reason to share.
No narration. Original Halloween music and wordless ghost choir only.

